    "在 \\((1,1)\\) 处因子 \\(\\dfrac{x-y}{\\sqrt{1+x^{2}}}=0\\)，故对指数部分求导所得项含此因子，其值为 \\(0\\)。",
    "\\(F'_{x}(1,1)=\\mathrm{e}^{2}\\cdot\\left.\\dfrac{\\partial}{\\partial x}\\dfrac{x-y}{\\sqrt{1+x^{2}}}\\right|_{(1,1)}\\)。",
    "\\(\\dfrac{\\partial}{\\partial x}\\dfrac{x-y}{\\sqrt{1+x^{2}}}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{1+x^{2}}-(x-y)\\dfrac{x}{\\sqrt{1+x^{2}}}}{1+x^{2}}\\)，在 \\((1,1)\\) 处为 \\(\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\)。",
    "于是 \\(F'_{x}(1,1)=\\dfrac{\\mathrm{e}^{2}}{\\sqrt{2}}\\)。",
    "\\(F'_{y}(1,1)=\\mathrm{e}^{2}\\cdot\\left.\\dfrac{\\partial}{\\partial y}\\dfrac{x-y}{\\sqrt{1+x^{2}}}\\right|_{(1,1)}=\\mathrm{e}^{2}\\left(-\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right)=-\\dfrac{\\mathrm{e}^{2}}{\\sqrt{2}}\\)。",
    "相加得 \\(F'_{x}(1,1)+F'_{y}(1,1)=0\\)，选 D。"
