   "text": "设 \\((X,Y)\\sim N\\!\\left(0,0;\\dfrac{1}{2},\\dfrac{1}{2};0\\right)\\)，\\(\\Phi(x)\\) 为标准正态分布函数，则 \\(P\\{X-Y>E(|X-Y|)\\}=\\)\nA. \\(1-\\Phi\\!\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)\\).\nB. \\(1-\\Phi(\\sqrt{2})\\).\nC. \\(1-\\Phi\\!\\left(\\sqrt{\\dfrac{2}{\\pi}}\\right)\\).\nD. \\(1-\\Phi\\!\\left(\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{\\pi}\\right)\\).",
